      "receiptText": "\u003Cb\u003EBarford Pudding.\u003C/b\u003E\u003Cbr\u003E\n944. Take one pound of beef suet, one pound of raisins, five well-beaten eggs, four spoonfuls of flour, six ounces of loaf sugar, half a nutmeg, and a little salt; mix them well, put them in a basin, and boil four hours.\u003Cbr\u003E"
